over the limit: HTTP/1.1 503 Service Unavailable
after the first has gone: HTTP/1.1 200 OK
idle: closed, 0 bytes
stalled: HTTP/1.1 408 Request Timeout
trickle: HTTP/1.1 408 Request Timeout; stopped before the end: True
kept then idle: HTTP/1.1 200 OK then closed
not reading: got part of it: True
afterwards: HTTP/1.1 200 OK
